// 554:24
[com_24]
type=text
x=29
y=25
width=179
height=251
layer=page2
textfont=verdana_11pt_regular_multiline
text=  Many are the forms and names of these fiends, these lords of the pit.  They come arrayed for war, with gleaming tusk and iron claw.  Nothing may stand against their fury.  Nothing is left in their wake but ruination.<br><br>  As a fire hungers for fuel, so too do they hunger for blood and suffering.  Every blow they land heals them of even the most grievous wounds.  Beware, lest by facing your foe you pave the way to your doom!
colour=0x010000

